Strawberry Post tests
=====================

`native/test_domain` covers the allocation-free domain algorithms shared with
the firmware. `native/test_storage` uses an in-memory file backend to exercise
storage recovery and atomic replacement. `native/test_epaper` covers display
text sanitising, line wrapping, notice rotation, button debounce, QR/notice
snapshot hashing, and refresh policy.

Run only the desktop environment:

    pio test --environment native

PlatformIO supplies Unity but not a host compiler. GCC/G++ must be available on
PATH. Hardware network, captive-portal, SD/LittleFS power-cut, live card-removal,
and load behavior remain outside these suites.

`tools/test_web_preview.py` starts the desktop mock server on an ephemeral port
and checks the generated web bundle plus public and authenticated HTTP flows,
including paged history and degraded-storage UI state.
Run it with:

    python -m unittest discover -s test\tools -v
